The '''Goliath Barbarian''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Barbarian Outpost}}. It is a stronger version of the [[Barbarian]].

== Spawning ==
The '''Goliath Barbarian''' can rarely spawn in the {{Zone|Barbarian Outpost}} on the [[Crimson Isle]].

