Killing a '''Goliath Barbarian''' when the player is in the [[Barbarian Faction]] will make them lose {{Reputation|Barbarian|25}}. If the player is in the [[Mage Faction]] and they kill a '''Goliath Barbarian''', they will gain {{Reputation|Mage|25}}, only if they have negative reputation.

== Behavior ==
When attacked, the '''Goliath Barbarian''' will run towards the player and try to attack them, dealing {{Stat|dmg|4,000}} on hit. Every 10 seconds, the '''Goliath Barbarian''' will gain more maximum {{Stat|hp}}, and set its health to that number. Its maximum {{Stat|hp}} is capped at {{HP|11M}}.

